.TH CODLAB-THEMA 1 "2026-11-05" "CodLab Thema 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
codlab-thema \- manage CodLab Thema for the current desktop user
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B codlab-thema
.RI "attiva | disattiva | stato"
.SH DESCRIPTION
System extensions for GNOME Shell 51 and optional glass effects inside Files.
Package installation does not activate them for any user.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B attiva
Enable the packaged extensions for the current user. Requires GNOME Shell 51.
New system extensions become available on the next login.
.TP
.B disattiva
Disable the packaged extensions while preserving other extensions.
Run this command before removing the package.
.TP
.B stato
Display configured activation and the optional donation link.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/codlab-thema/attivo
Explicit consent for glass effects inside Files.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gnome-extensions (1),
.BR gsettings (1)
